@startuml
title bd LINE / delete-breakpoint LINE — Remove a breakpoint
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
U -> UI : bd LINE / delete-breakpoint LINE
UI -> S : delete_line_breakpoint(LINE)
S -> S : Delete exact requested-line key and clear stopped_line
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
